#   silik snapshot [status | list | create [NAME] | delete NAME | setup] [--json]   snapshots of / (LVM thin, snapm)
#   silik rollback [NAME] [--yes] | finish | --packages [ID]   go back to before the last update; never restarts
#   silik update channel [stable | next | off]           SilikOS's own packages: the repository they are updated from
#   silik eda   list | create NAME --el 6|7|8 | setup NAME | enter NAME | run NAME -- CMD... | import-vm DISK --name NAME
#               | rm NAME | check | kernel-arg
#   silik win   open [--prefix P --isolated --no-net --no-sandbox --yes] FILE [ARGS] | apps | sync | stop [PREFIX]
#               | list | create PREFIX | run [--no-net --no-sandbox] PREFIX -- PROG.exe [ARGS] | install PREFIX SETUP.exe | rm PREFIX
#               | vm create --iso WIN.iso [--name N --ram GB --disk GB --cpus N] | vm start [N] | vm stop [N]
#               | vm app --exe 'C:\path\app.exe' --user U | vm usb [attach|detach VID:PID] [--name N]
