#               | check [--battery] [--json]          what decides this machine's consumption, each ok / warn / unknown
#               | charge [N | apply]                  the battery's charge limit (80: for its life; 100: none)
#               | profiles [silikos | base]           the tuned profiles behind the words: SilikOS's saver or the base's
