#   silik update
#   silik secure status [--json] [--offline] | apply [--keep-ssh]
#               | level [--json] | level hardened [--without ITEM]... [--keep-ssh] | level hardened --list | level default
#               the level this system is at; the hardened level, item by item, and the way back (docs/HARDENED.md)
#   silik doctor [--json] [--verbose] [AREA...]       is this workstation healthy, and what to do: system security
